The simplicity in the shape of earings.  
These Half-Disk eating are simple but yet can be a good addition of colour to your jewellery.

The available colours are: yellow, olive, cognac, brown, violet, turquoise (ortensia), natural (beige), dark red, black, blue-jeans.

